  "steps": [
    "<strong>Roast Aubergine:</strong> Preheat oven to 180°C fan / 200°C. Toss aubergine with olive oil, tamari, maple syrup, salt, and pepper on a lined tray. Add whole garlic clove and roast 25 min, stirring halfway.",
    "<strong>Cook Beans:</strong> Heat olive oil in a large pan over medium-high heat. Add spring onions, garlic, and cherry tomatoes. Cover and cook ~10 min until tomatoes burst, stirring and lightly mashing.",
    "Drain beans, reserving liquid. Add beans, ~100 g bean liquid, sun-dried tomatoes, coconut yoghurt, and tomato purée. Stir and warm through ~10 min.",
    "Add lemon juice and spinach; cook 5 min until spinach wilts.",
    "<strong>Serve:</strong> Spoon beans into bowls, top with roasted aubergine, extra yoghurt, pine nuts, basil, and black pepper. Serve with bread if desired."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Keeps well in the fridge for 2–3 days and freezes for up to 1 month.",
